WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.240
Welcome to MatchSense.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:08.131
This is a live dashboard walkthrough using a fictional, fixed-seed match, not a live fixture.

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:16.607
The overview shows Harbour Rovers leading Ridgeway Athletic three-nil, with 488 events processed and seven approved detections.

00:00:16.607 --> 00:00:21.155
The momentum timeline compares control scores in five-minute windows.

00:00:21.155 --> 00:00:24.810
I open event volume to inspect the source activity.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:30.095
A change in control is a reason to investigate, not proof of a tactical cause.

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:38.595
Here is the approved Harbour Rovers insight for minutes fifty-five to sixty: the control score rises from point five-nine to point seven-four.

00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:45.179
The Evidence Receipt links observed events to derived metrics, then the interpreted claim and Critic decision.

00:00:45.179 --> 00:00:50.512
The same verified claim has fan, analyst, and broadcast presentations.

00:00:50.512 --> 00:00:54.000
The wording adapts; its evidence stays fixed.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.179
The Critic blocks a formation claim because formations are absent from the event data.

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:05.464
It also blocks invented possession and shot totals, plus a fatigue claim that this feed cannot observe.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:10.381
Finally, the forty-to-forty-five-minute Ridgeway Athletic window is approved.

00:01:10.381 --> 00:01:19.464
Its claim reads three independent signals moving together, built from shots, threat, and recoveries, and all seven detections pass verification.

00:01:19.464 --> 00:01:30.095
The current MVP includes event validation, rolling metrics, control-shift detection, receipts, verification, audience styles, an API, and this dashboard.

00:01:30.095 --> 00:01:33.262
Other detector types remain roadmap work.

00:01:33.262 --> 00:01:37.595
Follow the events, check the calculation, then review the claim.

00:01:37.595 --> 00:01:40.060
All match data is synthetic.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.869
Thanks for watching.
